# A two-section input handled with Channels.
#
# Section one is a roster, section two is a scores list. Each Channel
# branches from the same upstream value (the section list), processes its
# own section, and Combine recombines them: squad size × 1000 + total score.
#
#   domain examples/05_two_sections.domain
#   Expected output: 4290
Cursed Energy: 05_two_sections.input
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n\n"

Channel "squad":
    Cursed Technique: Take Item 0
    Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
    Maximum Technique: Count

Channel "score":
    Cursed Technique: Take Item 1
    Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
    Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
    Maximum Technique: Sum

Maximum Technique: Combine
    From: squad, score
    Using: (squad, score) -> squad * 1000 + score

Reveal: stdout
